--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.client_onboarding.blockers IS 'Array of {code, detail, at}. Populated when the pipeline hits missing or unsafe context (unreviewed allergy, ambiguous email match, unstated client_type, thin meal library). The pipeline stops and records the gap rather than producing a plausible plan.';

